{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FG2TZSDWcM4NLiEvQoKDDW","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t//! Spin-bit policy implementations.\n2\t//!\n3\t//! Concrete types implementing [`crate::internal::SpinBitPolicy`].\n4\t//! [`crate::internal::SPIN_FUNCTION_TABLE`] entries are indexed by\n5\t//! [`crate::SpinbitVersion`] discriminant:\n6\t//! * 0 (`Basic`) → [`BasicSpinBit`]\n7\t//! * 1 (`Random`) → [`RandomSpinBit`]\n8\t//! * 2 (`Null`) → [`NullSpinBit`]\n9\t//!\n10\t//! C: `picoquic/spinbit.c` and the `picoquic_spin_function_table[]` array.\n11\t\n12\tuse crate::internal::{Connection, PacketHeader, Path, SpinBitPolicy};\n13\t\n14\t// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n15\t// Basic spin-bit policy.\n16\t\n17\t/// Reflects the incoming spin bit XOR client_mode, echoes path[0]'s spin\n18\t/// on outgoing packets.\n19\t/// C: `picoquic_spinbit_basic_incoming` / `picoquic_spinbit_basic_outgoing`\n20\t/// in `picoquic/spinbit.c`.\n21\tpub struct BasicSpinBit;\n22\t\n23\timpl SpinBitPolicy for BasicSpinBit {\n24\t    /// C: `picoquic/spinbit.c:picoquic_spinbit_basic_incoming` (line 32–35).\n25\t    fn incoming(&self, connection: &mut Connection, path_x: &mut Path, ph: &PacketHeader) {\n26\t        path_x.current_spin = ph.spin ^ connection.client_mode;\n27\t    }\n28\t\n29\t    /// C: `picoquic/spinbit.c:picoquic_spinbit_basic_outgoing` (line 37–42).\n30\t    fn outgoing(&self, connection: &mut Connection) -> u8 {\n31\t        let spin = connection\n32\t            .paths\n33\t            .first()\n34\t            .map(|p| p.current_spin)\n35\t            .unwrap_or(false);\n36\t        (spin as u8) << 5\n37\t    }\n38\t}\n39\t\n40\t// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n41\t// Null spin-bit policy.\n42\t\n43\t/// No-op incoming; zero outgoing.\n44\t/// C: `picoquic_spinbit_null_incoming` / `picoquic_spinbit_null_outgoing`\n45\t/// in `picoquic/spinbit.c`.\n46\tpub struct NullSpinBit;\n47\t\n48\timpl SpinBitPolicy for NullSpinBit {\n49\t    /// C: `picoquic/spinbit.c:picoquic_spinbit_null_incoming` (line 48–53).\n50\t    fn incoming(&self, _connection: &mut Connection, _path_x: &mut Path, _ph: &PacketHeader) {}\n51\t\n52\t    fn outgoing(&self, _connection: &mut Connection) -> u8 {\n53\t        0\n54\t    }\n55\t}\n56\t\n57\t// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n58\t// Random spin-bit policy.\n59\t\n60\t/// No-op incoming; random bit-5 value outgoing.\n61\t/// C: `picoquic_spinbit_random_incoming` / `picoquic_spinbit_random_outgoing`\n62\t/// in `picoquic/spinbit.c`.\n63\tpub struct RandomSpinBit;\n64\t\n65\timpl SpinBitPolicy for RandomSpinBit {\n66\t    /// C: `picoquic/spinbit.c:picoquic_spinbit_random_incoming` (line 65–69).\n67\t    fn incoming(&self, _connection: &mut Connection, _path_x: &mut Path, _ph: &PacketHeader) {}\n68\t\n69\t    fn outgoing(&self, _connection: &mut Connection) -> u8 {\n70\t        // C: `(uint8_t)(picoquic_public_random_64() & 0x20)` — bit 5 is the\n71\t        // spin-bit position in the QUIC short header first byte.\n72\t        crate::public_random_64() as u8 & 0x20\n73\t    }\n74\t}\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c078a458-8d27-4b1b-b12a-e775d28f8c36","uuid":"a0fa3d40-5396-4f22-8fc2-524c7cc21c13","timestamp":"2026-05-07T09:32:43.786Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/richbarn/Projects/picoquic/rs/fq/src/spinbit.rs","content":"//! Spin-bit policy implementations.\n//!\n//! Concrete types implementing [`crate::internal::SpinBitPolicy`].\n//! [`crate::internal::SPIN_FUNCTION_TABLE`] entries are indexed by\n//! [`crate::SpinbitVersion`] discriminant:\n//! * 0 (`Basic`) → [`BasicSpinBit`]\n//! * 1 (`Random`) → [`RandomSpinBit`]\n//! * 2 (`Null`) → [`NullSpinBit`]\n//!\n//! C: `picoquic/spinbit.c` and the `picoquic_spin_function_table[]` array.\n\nuse crate::internal::{Connection, PacketHeader, Path, SpinBitPolicy};\n\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Basic spin-bit policy.\n\n/// Reflects the incoming spin bit XOR client_mode, echoes path[0]'s spin\n/// on outgoing packets.\n/// C: `picoquic_spinbit_basic_incoming` / `picoquic_spinbit_basic_outgoing`\n/// in `picoquic/spinbit.c`.\npub struct BasicSpinBit;\n\nimpl SpinBitPolicy for BasicSpinBit {\n    /// C: `picoquic/spinbit.c:picoquic_spinbit_basic_incoming` (line 32–35).\n    fn incoming(&self, connection: &mut Connection, path_x: &mut Path, ph: &PacketHeader) {\n        path_x.current_spin = ph.spin ^ connection.client_mode;\n    }\n\n    /// C: `picoquic/spinbit.c:picoquic_spinbit_basic_outgoing` (line 37–42).\n    fn outgoing(&self, connection: &mut Connection) -> u8 {\n        let spin = connection\n            .paths\n            .first()\n            .map(|p| p.current_spin)\n            .unwrap_or(false);\n        (spin as u8) << 5\n    }\n}\n\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Null spin-bit policy.\n\n/// No-op incoming; zero outgoing.\n/// C: `picoquic_spinbit_null_incoming` / `picoquic_spinbit_null_outgoing`\n/// in `picoquic/spinbit.c`.\npub struct NullSpinBit;\n\nimpl SpinBitPolicy for NullSpinBit {\n    /// C: `picoquic/spinbit.c:picoquic_spinbit_null_incoming` (line 48–53).\n    fn incoming(&self, _connection: &mut Connection, _path_x: &mut Path, _ph: &PacketHeader) {}\n\n    fn outgoing(&self, _connection: &mut Connection) -> u8 {\n        0\n    }\n}\n\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Random spin-bit policy.\n\n/// No-op incoming; random bit-5 value outgoing.\n/// C: `picoquic_spinbit_random_incoming` / `picoquic_spinbit_random_outgoing`\n/// in `picoquic/spinbit.c`.\npub struct RandomSpinBit;\n\nimpl SpinBitPolicy for RandomSpinBit {\n    /// C: `picoquic/spinbit.c:picoquic_spinbit_random_incoming` (line 65–69).\n    fn incoming(&self, _connection: &mut Connection, _path_x: &mut Path, _ph: &PacketHeader) {}\n\n    fn outgoing(&self, _connection: &mut Connection) -> u8 {\n        // C: `(uint8_t)(picoquic_public_random_64() & 0x20)` — bit 5 is the\n        // spin-bit position in the QUIC short header first byte.\n        crate::public_random_64() as u8 & 0x20\n    }\n}\n","numLines":75,"startLine":1,"totalLines":75}}}
